   },
   "text": {
    "en": "3.—(1) Item (4) of the Schedule to the Protected Areas (Consolidation) Order (O 15) is deleted.\n(2) The Protected Areas (No. 3) Order 2010 (G.N. No. S 539/2010) is revoked."
   }
